 Affects Your 2026 Refund\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"what-to-do-if-your-refund-is-late\",\"text\":\"What to Do If Your Refund Is Late\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"state-tax-refund-schedule\",\"text\":\"State Tax Refund Schedule\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"tips-for-faster-refunds\",\"text\":\"Tips for Faster Refunds\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"frequently-asked-questions\",\"text\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"related-resources\",\"text\":\"Related Resources\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"sources\",\"text\":\"Sources\",\"level\":2}]}]}]}],\"$L29\"]}],\"$L2a\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Author: Rachel Mitchell\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-5 sm:p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\",\"alt\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\",\"width\":48,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"href\":\"/about#rachel-mitchell\",\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"CPA\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[\"Lead Tax Analyst & Editorial Director\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with